content:
Grouping uses the ordering table: two part numbers (02C = 0°C~+70°C, 02I = -40°C~+85°C), same 1310 nm / 6.144 Gbps / 2 km. TX centre wavelength 1270–1350 nm applies to both; RX 1260–1600 nm is passband on the same module, not a separate selectable mode. Bit rates 1.0, 6.144, and 6.25 Gbps are one min/typ/max row—not four modes; 6.1 Gbps is narrative only.

```json
{
  "modes": [
    {
      "label": "LS-SM316G-02C Standard 6.144G 1310nm 2km",
      "model": "LS-SM316G-02C",
      "wavelength_min_nm": 1270.0,
      "wavelength_max_nm": 1350.0,
      "bit_rate_gbps": 6.144
    },
    {
      "label": "LS-SM316G-02I Industrial 6.144G 1310nm 2km",
      "model": "LS-SM316G-02I",
      "wavelength_min_nm": 1270.0,
      "wavelength_max_nm": 1350.0,
      "bit_rate_gbps": 6.144
    }
  ]
}
```
